{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55304","headline":"寄邓洵美 · 王溥","name":"寄邓洵美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衡阳归鴈别重湖，衘到同人一纸书。\n忽见姓名双泪落，不知消息十年余。\n彩衣我已登黄合，白社君犹葺旧居。\n南望荆门千里外，暮云重叠满晴虚。\n（见前书同卷引《雅言系述》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王溥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}